<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Clinical Concierge | Stop Missing Patients</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: { sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'] },
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            blue: '#0052FF',
                            dark: '#0A0F1C',
                            light: '#F3F6FF'
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
</head>
<body class="font-sans text-brand-dark antialiased bg-white">

    <nav class="w-full py-6 px-6 md:px-12 flex justify-between items-center max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">CarolinaRedesign<span class="text-brand-blue">.</span></div>
        <a href="#book" class="text-sm font-semibold hover:text-brand-blue transition hidden md:block">For Surgeons & MedSpas</a>
    </nav>

    <header class="w-full pt-16 pb-24 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
        <div class="md:w-1/2 text-center md:text-left">
            <div class="inline-block bg-blue-50 text-brand-blue px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide mb-6">
                The Clinical Concierge
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-6">
                Your phones are ringing. <br>
                <span class="text-gray-400">Your patients are waiting.</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed max-w-lg mx-auto md:mx-0">
                Deploy the first HIPAA-intelligent AI Receptionist that answers every call, triages patient needs, and syncs appointments 24/7—without burning out your staff.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center md:justify-start">
                <a href="#book" class="bg-brand-blue text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl text-center">
                    Audit My Patient Experience
                </a>
                <button onclick="window.MedBot.open()" class="px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold border border-gray-200 hover:border-brand-blue hover:text-brand-blue transition text-center">
                    Listen to a Live Demo
                </button>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-green-600 font-medium flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-1">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full"></span> HIPAA Compliant Architecture
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="md:w-1/2 relative">
            <div class="relative z-10 bg-brand-dark rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-2xl max-w-sm mx-auto transform rotate-1 hover:rotate-0 transition duration-500">
                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 mb-4">
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-blue flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold">A</div>
                        <div class="bg-gray-700 p-3 rounded-lg rounded-tl-none text-sm text-gray-200">
                            Hi Sarah, I see you're interested in Rhinoplasty. Are you looking to address a functional issue or cosmetic?
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 mb-4 ml-8">
                    <div class="bg-brand-blue p-3 rounded-lg rounded-tr-none text-sm text-white">
                        Mostly cosmetic. I hate my profile, but I'm worried about the cost.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-blue flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold">A</div>
                        <div class="bg-gray-700 p-3 rounded-lg rounded-tl-none text-sm text-gray-200">
                            I understand completely. We offer financing plans starting at $150/mo. Would you like to see if you pre-qualify?
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-xl border border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="bg-green-100 p-2 rounded-full text-green-600">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase font-bold">Result</div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-gray-900">Lead Qualified</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-100 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10 opacity-50"></div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="py-24 bg-gray-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-16">
                <div class="md:w-1/3">
                    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">The "Front Desk" Bottleneck</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">In the modern practice, the phone is the enemy of efficiency.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="md:w-2/3 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
                        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-blue mb-2">30%</div>
                        <div class="font-bold mb-2">Abandonment Rate</div>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Patients hang up after 2 minutes on hold. They don't call back—they call the next practice on Google.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
                        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-blue mb-2">4hrs</div>
                        <div class="font-bold mb-2">Staff Fatigue</div>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Your skilled nurses spend hours answering "Are you open?" instead of focusing on patient care.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
                        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-blue mb-2">40%</div>
                        <div class="font-bold mb-2">After-Hours Gap</div>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Patient inquiries happen after 5:00 PM. If they can't book instantly, that revenue goes to Urgent Care.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-24 bg-brand-dark text-white">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-16">
            <div class="md:w-1/2">
                <div class="text-brand-blue font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-4">The Solution</div>
                <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-8">Infinite Capacity. <br>Zero Wait Times.</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg mb-8">We install a custom-trained Voice & Text AI agent that acts as your "Digital Triage Nurse." It doesn't just take messages—it resolves problems.</p>
                
                <ul class="space-y-6">
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-blue mt-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        <div>
                            <strong class="block text-white">Instant Answer</strong>
                            <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Picks up on the first ring, 24/7/365.</span>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-blue mt-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        <div>
                            <strong class="block text-white">Intelligent Triage</strong>
                            <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Distinguishes between refills, emergencies, and bookings.</span>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-blue mt-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        <div>
                            <strong class="block text-white">Dynamic Booking</strong>
                            <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Syncs directly with your calendar.</span>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="md:w-1/2 relative">
                <div class="bg-brand-blue p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl relative z-10">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">The Economics of Access</h3>
                    <p class="text-blue-100 text-lg mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                        "If this system recovers just <strong class="text-white">one missed new patient appointment</strong> per week, it pays for itself."
                    </p>
                    <div class="text-xs text-blue-200 uppercase tracking-wide">Everything else is pure practice profit.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer id="book" class="py-24 px-6 text-center">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Modernize your practice.</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-10 text-lg">We are accepting 3 partner practices for our Q1 Pilot Program.</p>
            
            <a href="#" class="inline-block bg-brand-dark text-white px-10 py-5 rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:bg-black transition shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-1 transform duration-200">
                Schedule Strategy Call
            </a>

            <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-gray-100 text-xs text-gray-400 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center">
                <p>© 2026 CarolinaRedesign Medical Solutions.</p>
                <div class="flex gap-4 mt-4 md:mt-0">
                    <span>Privacy Policy</span>
                    <span>HIPAA Compliance</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <div id="med-bot-root"></div>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://[YOUR-RENDER-URL].onrender.com/widget/frontend.css">
    <script src="https://[YOUR-RENDER-URL].onrender.com/widget.js"></script>
    <script>
        window.onload = function() {
            if (window.MedBot) {
                window.MedBot.init({
                    apiUrl: 'https://[YOUR-RENDER-URL].onrender.com', // Replace with your Render URL
                    containerId: 'med-bot-root'
                });
            }
        };
    </script>

</body>
</html>
